  <p id="c-nanshi-046-wangyuanchu-anmin:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">先是宋時亡命<persName id="c-nanshi-046-wangyuanchu-anmin:p001:m0006" ref="7u6_d9k_zzx">王元初</persName>聚黨六合山，僭大號。自雲垂手過膝。州郡討不能禽，積十餘年。<persName id="c-nanshi-046-wangyuanchu-anmin:p001:m0038" ref="4xf_x1f_vsg">安人</persName>生禽之，斬建康市。</p>
</text>
